arse-cv skill\n    41\t3. **Call generate-latex**: Pass the JSON output and chosen template to generate-latex skill\n    42\t4. **Call compile-pdf**: Pass the generated .tex file to compile-pdf skill\n    43\t5. **Return result**: Inform user the output PDF is ready in output/ directory\n    44\t\n    45\t## Output Format\n    46\t\n    47\tFinal output should be: `output/resume.pdf`', name='read_file', id='4f624846-69b8-4ab8-a387-1d210e40ca33', tool_call_id='WWWfkfPGa'), AIMessage(content='I will now process the resume using the resume-builder skill. Starting with Step 1: Parse CV.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_name': 'mistralai/mistral-small-2603', 'id': 'gen-1776798228-dJTgsqOomKsi1kMtA3Lc', 'created': 1776798228, 'object': 'chat.completion', 'finish_reason': 'tool_calls', 'logprobs': None, 'model_provider': 'openrouter'}, id='lc_run--019db16d-5f71-7333-8db8-044482336f65-0', tool_calls=[{'name': 'task', 'args': {'description': 'Parse the resume at /Users/admin/VSCode/LatexCVMaker/input/resume.pdf and extract structured JSON data.\n\nUse the parse-cv skill to extract:\n- Contact info\n- Summary\n- Experience\n- Education\n- Skills\n\nExpected output format: Structured JSON data ready for LaTeX template population.', 'subagent_type': 'general-purpose'}, 'id': 'LYm7IZD4Q', 'type': 'tool_call'}], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 7236, 'output_tokens': 110, 'total_tokens': 7346, 'input_token_details': {'cache_read': 6528, 'cache_creation': 0}, 'output_token_details': {'reasoning': 0}}), ToolMessage(content='Structured JSON data has been successfully extracted from the resume PDF! Here is the structured JSON data ready for LaTeX template population:\n\n```json\n{\n  "contact": {\n    "name": "John Doe",\n    "email": "john.doe@example.com",\n    "phone": "+1 (123) 456-7890",\n    "location": "New York, NY",\n    "linkedin": "linkedin.com/in/johndoe",\n    "github": "github.com/johndoe"\n  },\n  "summary": "Experienced software engineer with 5+ years of expertise in Python, machine learning, and web development. Passionate about building scalable applications and solving complex problems.",\n  "experience": [\n    {\n      "company": "Tech Solutions Inc.",\n      "position": "Senior Software Engineer",\n      "duration": "Jan 2020 - Present",\n      "description": [\n        "Developed and maintained scalable Python applications using Django and Flask.",\n        "Led a team of 5 engineers to deliver projects on time and within budget.",\n        "Implemented machine learning models to improve user experience by 30%.",\n        "Collaborated with cross-functional teams to define product roadmaps."\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      "company": "Innovate Labs",\n      "position": "Software Engineer",\n      "duration": "Jun 2017 - Dec 2019",\n      "description": [\n        "Designed and deployed RESTful APIs for internal and external clients.",\n        "Optimized database queries, reducing response time by 40%.",\n        "Mentored junior developers and conducted code reviews."\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  "education": [\n    {\n      "institution": "State University",\n      "degree": "Master of Science in Computer Science",\n      "year": "2017"\n    },\n    {\n      "institution": "Tech College",\n      "degree": "Bachelor of Science in Software Engineering",\n      "year": "2015"\n    }\n  ],\n  "skills": [\n    "Python",\n    "Machine Learning",\n    "Django",\n    "Flask",\n    "RESTful APIs",\n    "SQL",\n    "Git",\n    "AWS",\n    "Docker",\n    "JavaScript"\n  ]\n}\n```', name='task', id='7b97c639-5b5c-4bfa-8fd2-6bfe642e5310', tool_call_id='LYm7IZD4Q'), AIMessage(content='Step 1 (Parse CV) completed successfully. Now moving to Step 2: Generate LaTeX. I will use the modern template to generate the LaTeX file.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_name': 'mistralai/mistral-small-2603', 'id': 'gen-1776798247-AEZIKOpBNpEzwbRAJv5Y', 'created': 1776798247, 'object': 'chat.completio