   "Machine Learning",\n    "Django",\n    "Flask",\n    "RESTful APIs",\n    "SQL",\n    "Git",\n    "AWS",\n    "Docker",\n    "JavaScript"\n  ]\n}\n```\n\nTask:\n- Use the modern LaTeX template from templates/modern\n- Populate the template with the provided JSON data\n- Write the generated .tex file to /Users/admin/VSCode/LatexCVMaker/output/resume.tex', 'subagent_type': 'general-purpose'}, 'id': 'oh8TdxBrT', 'type': 'tool_call'}], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 7841, 'output_tokens': 710, 'total_tokens': 8551, 'input_token_details': {'cache_read': 0, 'cache_creation': 0}, 'output_token_details': {'reasoning': 0}}), ToolMessage(content="The LaTeX file for the resume has been successfully generated at `/Users/admin/VSCode/LatexCVMaker/output/resume.tex` using the modern template and the provided JSON data. The file includes:\n\n1. **Contact Information**: Name, email, phone, location, LinkedIn, and GitHub.\n2. **Professional Summary**: A concise summary of the candidate's expertise and passion.\n3. **Experience**: Two entries with bullet points detailing responsibilities and achievements.\n4. **Education**: Degrees and institutions with years.\n5. **Skills**: A comma-separated list of technical skills.\n\nThe LaTeX file is now ready for compilation into a PDF using `pdflatex` or `latexmk`.", name='task', id='8e8f3ec7-cc9b-471d-bbf9-cc47ea90970e', tool_call_id='oh8TdxBrT'), AIMessage(content='Step 2 (Generate LaTeX) completed successfully. The LaTeX file has been generated at `/Users/admin/VSCode/LatexCVMaker/output/resume.tex`. Now moving to Step 3: Compile PDF.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_name': 'mistralai/mistral-small-2603', 'id': 'gen-1776798278-sE3pUTnMNDp9wJFTbvx1', 'created': 1776798278, 'object': 'chat.completion', 'finish_reason': 'tool_calls', 'logprobs': None, 'model_provider': 'openrouter'}, id='lc_run--019db16e-24aa-7a20-9590-63d37d6cd8fb-0', tool_calls=[{'name': 'task', 'args': {'description': 'Compile t